{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Balaspire </strong>is a roguelike where\u00a0<i>spell-card casting</i><strong> </strong>and <i>card-matching combos </i>go hand in hand to create a strategic deckbuilder roguelite! Throw out cards to cast powerful spells, and then form hand-combos of matching cards to hit your enemies hard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/Frame_2.png?t=1753197098\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match up elements and runes to rack up bigger numbers when you attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/6bddfa48d76fd2c9ec0b4f107e9bad4a.poster.avif?t=1753197098\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/6bddfa48d76fd2c9ec0b4f107e9bad4a.webm?t=1753197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/6bddfa48d76fd2c9ec0b4f107e9bad4a.mp4?t=1753197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/Frame_4.png?t=1753197098\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matching-combos aren\u2019t the only way to hit hard \u2013 fill your deck with spells and discover trinkets that synergise with your strategy to grow your power exponentially!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/90547158d657f24b96e97a38ba2a3b39.poster.avif?t=1753197098\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/90547158d657f24b96e97a38ba2a3b39.webm?t=1753197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/90547158d657f24b96e97a38ba2a3b39.mp4?t=1753197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/Frame_5.png?t=1753197098\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend down the <i>Balaspire</i> \u2013 a mysterious subterranean tower where the deeper you go, the stranger things become\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/Frame_6__2_.png?t=1753197098\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has a focus on different strategies for you to explore as you make your runs down into the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/8d347cf7b182764174432f239071f478.poster.avif?t=1753197098\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/8d347cf7b182764174432f239071f478.webm?t=1753197098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/8d347cf7b182764174432f239071f478.mp4?t=1753197098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p